# Bug: Password-protected chat accessible without password

## Description
A password-protected chat can be accessed even without entering the password.

## Steps to Reproduce
1. Log in with Profile A with Premium activated.
2. Create a password-protected chat.
3. Log out.
4. Log in with Profile B without Premium.
5. Open the chat.
6. Close the Premium activation popup.

## Expected Result
User should not access the chat without entering the password and activating Premium.

## Actual Result
User can close the popup and still access and send messages in the locked chat.

## Impact
Password protection can be bypassed.
